# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AI Assistant — optional configuration (client-side)
#
#The chatbot works out of the box: it auto-detects the best model installed in
# your local Ollama (e.g. `ollama list`)and uses it — no setup needed..
#
# Optional overrides (set in the browser console;the site is static, so server-
# side .env is not used by the widget):
#   localStorage.setItem('kb-ai-model', 'qwen2.5-coder:7b')
#   localStorage.setItem('kb-ai-base-url', 'http://127.0.0.1:11434/v1')
#
# For the browser to be allowed to call your local Ollama, restart the server with:
#   OLLAMA_ORIGINS="http://localhost:3000,http://127.0.0.1:3000" ollama serve
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────